# Generated by `tree-sitter generate` from grammar.js. Marked
# linguist-generated so GitHub excludes them from language stats and
# collapses them in diffs. (GitHub does not honor `-diff`, so the line
# counts can't be suppressed for committed text files — reviewers should
# ignore these and review grammar.js + the test corpus.)
# src/scanner.c is hand-written and intentionally left unmarked.
src/*.json          linguist-generated
src/parser.c        linguist-generated
src/tree_sitter/*   linguist-generated
